      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうして僕たちは波打ち際に向かい、\n簡単に泳ぎの練習を始めたのだが――。",
      "jp_sha256": "64ba07445c0729e74b14c9796aac64f49a9c8771d58a6bcdbdc82445e38a7833",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그렇게 우리는 물가로 향해\n간단히 수영 연습을 시작했지만――.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 54,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
